{"id":"fastlane-retest","title":"The fast-lane firms, measured again at the review desk","question":"Are the firms the fast-lane analysis found consistently faster from filing to issue also faster at each review station?","finding":"Of 17 consistently faster firms that could be tested in the City’s review table, 5 are also faster at the review desks (2 standard errors or more) and 2 are slower there. Of 29 consistently slower firms tested, 4 are slower at the desks too. 66 firms have fewer than 10 permits in the review table (most fast-lane firms work on counter permits, which this table does not cover).","how":"Firm names in the site’s “Who gets through faster” page (its consistently-faster, consistently-slower, fast-at-the-counter and never-held screens) were keyed with the same normaliser (fastlane.fk) and scored as in the screen before. A two-standard-error reading is used here because the list is short and was chosen in advance.","limits":"The review table covers permits that went through station review (permit types 1, 2, 3, 5, 6 and 9); counter approvals (type 8) appear only in the issuance table. A firm can be fast from filing to issue because its drawings need fewer rechecks, without any station treating it differently.","tier":"REDFLAG","columns":[{"k":"firm","t":"Firm","type":"org"},{"k":"fastlane","t":"Fast-lane finding","type":"text"},{"k":"permits","t":"Permits in review table","type":"int"},{"k":"place","t":"Average place (0 fastest)","type":"times"},{"k":"z","t":"Standard errors from typical","type":"times"},{"k":"reading","t":"Reading","type":"text"}],"rows":[{"firm":"Comstock Crosser & Assoc Develp Co Inc.","fastlane":"Held less often","permits":73,"place":0.338,"z":-22.6,"reading":"faster at the review desk"},{"firm":"Jackson Liles Architecture","fastlane":"Held less often","permits":76,"place":0.374,"z":-10.2,"reading":"faster at the review desk"},{"firm":"Clear Channel Outdoor","fastlane":"Held less often","permits":13,"place":0.3,"z":-8.8,"read